<title>USA: US cash DAP prices steady, ammonia steady-weak.</title>
<headline>US cash DAP prices steady, ammonia steady-weak.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash DAP prices were steady while U.S. Gulf ammonia values were unchanged to lower, fertilizer dealers said.</p>
<p>Demand was light for both DAP and ammonia, but dealers expect a gradual increase in demand next month as Midwest retailers increase inventories ahead of spring planting.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton	  Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   179-180		    Unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188			  Unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   220			  Unc-dn $5.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
